        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion G5, Rock Ridge Sandcast Bronze Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rock Ridge Sandcast Brass Handleset was designed with the rustic home in mind. It has an earthy feel, mostly from the sandcasting process which leaves natural divots in the brass for a unique, weathered look. The Rock Ridge Sandcast Bronze Handleset has a covered deadbolt. This handleset is available as a dummy function or a single cylinder function. It is made out of brass with an oil rubbed bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten brass is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Rock Ridge Handleset Fusion G5:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle:  6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>One Year Finish Warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
